        'state is:'
      )]),
      eqLabel('4', 'Ψ_D^x(t)  =  Ψ_D(t)  +  λ · F_x(t)'),
      para([t(
        'where λ is a coupling constant and F_x(t) = cos(2Ωt) · ΔQ_x is the host field vector, drawn ' +
