      )]),
      eqLabel('12', 'σ²_max  =  (|d₁|² + |d₂|²)/4  −  (d₁·d₂)/2'),
      para([t(
        'where d₁ = Q₁ − Q₀ and d₂ = Q₂ − Q₀ are the displacement vectors to the excited neighbours. ' +
